  ('article-lvfcpqed', 'feed-techcrunch', 'TechCrunch', 'Push for $40 smartphones builds momentum, but still faces cost hurdles', 'https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/07/push-for-40-smartphones-builds-momentum-but-still-faces-cost-hurdles/', 'Technology', '2026-03-08T05:00:00.000Z'::timestamptz, '2026-03-08T15:11:45.441Z'::timestamptz, 'A coalition of telecom operators and device makers is pushing $40 smartphones to bring up to 20 million people online, but rising component costs threaten the plan.', 'A coalition of telecom operators and device makers is pushing $40 smartphones to bring up to 20 million people online, but rising component costs threaten the plan.'),
